{"lines": ["How is Chris Pratt connected to Joseph Stalin?", "In twenty twenty-five, Chris Pratt joined his father-in-law, Arnold Schwarzenegger, at the premiere of FUBAR.", "In nineteen eighty-four, Arnold, already famous as the Terminator, met President Ronald Reagan at the Republican convention.", "In nineteen eighty-one, Reagan posed with Richard Nixon at the White House before Nixon flew to Sadat's funeral.", "In nineteen sixty-nine, Nixon visited Harry Truman in Missouri and played him a song on the piano.", "And in nineteen forty-five, Truman met Joseph Stalin at the Potsdam Conference to decide the fate of postwar Europe.", "How is Joseph Stalin connected to Steve from Minecraft?", "In nineteen forty-five, Joseph Stalin sat beside Winston Churchill at Yalta to plan the end of World War Two.", "In nineteen fifty-three, Prime Minister Churchill greeted the new Queen, Elizabeth the Second, and her children.", "In twenty fourteen, the Queen made Angelina Jolie an honorary dame at Buckingham Palace.", "In two thousand eight, Jolie and Jack Black brought Kung Fu Panda to the Cannes Film Festival.", "And in twenty twenty-five, Jack Black became Steve in A Minecraft Movie.", "How is Joseph Stalin connected to Optimus Prime?", "In December nineteen forty-nine, Mao Zedong came to Moscow for Stalin's seventieth birthday.", "In nineteen seventy-five, President Gerald Ford flew to Beijing and met Mao, a year before Mao died.", "Ford and George H W Bush were old friends, and in nineteen seventy-six Ford made Bush director of the CIA.", "In nineteen eighty-nine, President Bush welcomed movie star Robert Redford to the Oval Office.", "In twenty twelve, Redford premiered his film The Company You Keep in Venice with co-star Shia LaBeouf.", "In twenty twenty-five, Shia LaBeouf, star of Transformers, reunited with Peter Cullen at Steel City Con.", "And Optimus Prime is voiced by Peter Cullen, who played him for over forty years.", "How is Saddam Hussein connected to Cookie Monster?", "In nineteen eighty-three, Saddam Hussein shook hands with Donald Rumsfeld, sent to Baghdad as Reagan's special envoy.", "In two thousand six, after leading the Pentagon through the Iraq War, Rumsfeld resigned as George W Bush's defense secretary.", "In two thousand eight, days after the election, Bush welcomed Barack and Michelle Obama to the White House.", "And in twenty eleven, Michelle Obama posed on stage with Cookie Monster at an event for military families in Ohio.", "How is Adam connected to The Rock?", "Raphael painted Adam in heaven above Pope Sixtus the Fourth in his Vatican fresco, the Disputa.", "Sixtus was the 212th pope, and the line runs down to the 264th, Pope John Paul the Second.", "In nineteen eighty, John Paul the Second welcomed a young senator, Joe Biden, and his wife Jill to the Vatican.", "Back in twenty twelve, Ash Carter of the Pentagon handed Vice President Biden a model armored truck.", "As Defense Secretary in twenty sixteen, Carter met comedian Kevin Hart backstage at Late Night with Seth Meyers.", "And in Berlin that year, Hart posed with his Central Intelligence co-star, The Rock."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.42], ["is", 0.42, 0.66], ["Chris", 0.66, 0.96], ["Pratt", 0.96, 1.38], ["connected", 1.38, 1.98], ["to", 1.98, 2.34], ["Joseph", 2.34, 2.62], ["Stalin?", 2.62, 3.08], ["In", 4.0, 4.08], ["2025,", 4.08, 4.46], ["Chris", 5.04, 5.18], ["Pratt", 5.18, 5.46], ["joined", 5.46, 5.78], ["his", 5.78, 6.0], ["father", 6.0, 6.22], ["-in", 6.22, 6.42], ["-law,", 6.42, 6.6], ["Arnold", 6.96, 7.06], ["Schwarzenegger,", 7.06, 7.34], ["at", 8.02, 8.1], ["the", 8.1, 8.2], ["premiere", 8.2, 8.44], ["of", 8.44, 8.74], ["Fubar.", 8.74, 9.12], ["In", 9.7, 9.92], ["1984,", 9.92, 10.44], ["Arnold,", 10.96, 11.28], ["already", 11.6, 11.82], ["famous", 11.82, 12.08], ["as", 12.08, 12.32], ["the", 12.32, 12.46], ["Terminator,", 12.46, 12.68], ["met", 13.3, 13.42], ["President", 13.42, 13.78], ["Ronald", 13.78, 14.14], ["Reagan", 14.14, 14.48], ["at